Without a wish - Start as a chaotic wizard.  Do the sac
cycle to get Magicbane.  Do the prayer cycle until the
book you get is b+FoD.  Carry and do the sac cycle to
max out luck.  Do the prayer cycle until crowned to get
Stormbringer.  I have done this with far with a fair number
of wizards to have two artifacts that I like.  MB and
Stormy are excellent backups to each other depending
on context in your current game.

What I haven't tried yet after that - Use the helmet.  Do
the sac cycle hoping for Greyswandir.  At that point and
AC gained while getting books is lost and since you're
crowned the price of getting them back again is higher.


